  "verdict": {
    "ko": "품질 기준을 풀어도 처리량 수치는 bf16만 실측이다. nvfp4·w4a16은 이 모델에서 실측된 품질 손실(각각 -5.18%, -8.23%)은 갖고 있지만 이 하드웨어에서 서빙 처리량을 잰 적이 없어 Forge는 이를 certify하지 못한다. 반대로 fp8의 +0.66%는 '측정됨'으로 표시되지만 실제로는 Qwen3-0.6B가 아니라 다른 모델(Qwen3-Coder-30B-A3B)에서 잰 라우터 상수다. 같은 '측정됨' 라벨이 서로 다른 신뢰도를 가릴 수 있다는 것을 그대로 보여준다.",
    "en": "Loosening the quality goal never gets you a measured throughput number for anything but bf16, nvfp4 and w4a16 carry real quality losses measured on this exact model (-5.18% and -8.23%), but neither was ever served on this hardware, so Forge cannot certify their performance. Conversely fp8's +0.66% shows up as \"measured\" even though it was evaluated on a different model (Qwen3-Coder-30B-A3B, not Qwen3-0.6B), the same badge can hide very different confidence."
  },
  "provenance": {
    "backend": "forge library (src/forge/adapters: router_matrix.RouterMatrix, quality_overlay.MeasuredQualityOverlay, measured.MeasuredHarness) run locally on CPython 3.12 against the two committed artifacts under data/measured/*.json (in-house GPU, Qwen3-0.6B); no GPU job submitted",
